<view class="portal-page sfp-page"><view class="portal-nav" style="padding-top: {{navigationTop}}px; min-height: {{navigationHeight}}px; padding-right: {{navigationRight}}px;"><text class="nav-title">我的收益</text></view><view class="portal-intro sfp-hero-card"><text class="intro-title">当前企业的推荐收益</text><text class="intro-copy">本页只展示发放笔数与状态，不展示金额。</text><text wx:if="{{enterpriseName}}" class="enterprise-name">{{enterpriseName}}</text><view class="summary-row"><view><text class="summary-label">待发放</text><text class="summary-value">{{payableCountLabel}}</text></view><view><text class="summary-label">已发放</text><text class="summary-value">{{paidCountLabel}}</text></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-card sfp-card">正在读取收益…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state-card sfp-card"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="retry" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!items.length}}" class="state-card sfp-card"><text class="empty-title">暂时还没有收益记录</text><text class="empty-copy">企业完成签约后，符合条件的收益会显示在这里。</text><button class="return-action sfp-primary-action" bindtap="backToPromotion">返回推广</button></view><view wx:else class="fact-list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="fact-card sfp-card"><view class="fact-top"><text class="customer-label">{{item.customerLabel}}</text></view><view class="earning-meta"><text class="earning-status {{item.statusMeta.tone}}">{{item.statusMeta.label}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.status === 'paid' && item.paidAt}}">企业已完成支付</text></view></view></view></view>
<custom-tab-bar />
